  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbt/sbt/zipball/v2.0.9",
  "body": "## 🐛 bug fixes\r\n\r\n- fix: Fixes AccessDeniedException on Windows by creating JAR in situ by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/io/pull/558\r\n- fix: Fixes unhermetic `semanticdbTargetRoot` in the compile cache key by @christianharrington in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9711\r\n- fix: Fixes pipelined build with Java sources by @anatoliykmetyuk in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9574\r\n- fix: Keep macro subprojects off the pipelined classpath by @stasimus in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9719\r\n- fix: Fixes sbt runner script not starting on openSUSE by @alexasl in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9753\r\n- Update to sbtn 2.1.0-M1 https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9755\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sbt/sbt/compare/v2.0.8...v2.0.9",
